From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:01:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gfx: decode BC1-BC7 textures on CPU for GPUs without hardware
 BC support

Upstream-Status: fork-only (declined seedds/nxnative#488)
Reason: Support A15/A16 and older iOS GPUs without hardware BC texture compression including BC6H to RGB9E5
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#180
